          "text": "Projectile operations derive a launch pose from the array SurfaceFrame, direction runes, and velocity inputs, then hand it to the matching entity. EntityPayload and PersistentOp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "manage its lifecycle."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• MomentumOp handles direction, arrow count, size, and velocity geometry.\n• Fire, Water, and Mana projectiles use distinct entities and renderers, not only particles."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• OnEntityTickOp runs on server ticks; the client receives synchronized visual state."
